    "title": "Fishing group challenges Virginia's menhaden harvest quotas in lawsuit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sean Curtis ,\n1 days ago\nVIRGINIA BEACH, Va. - A Maryland recreational fishing organization is challenging Virginia’s management of menhaden, alleging state regulators bypassed public input when setting harvest quotas and failed to adequately protect a fish that feeds wildlife throughout the Chesapeake Bay. The Chesapeake Legal Alliance filed the petition Oct. 22 in...\nRead full article\n3",
